CLANBUFFS CLANBUFF CLANBUFFMANAGEMENT

CLAN BUFFS

  clan buffs
  clan buffs activate <family number> <tier> <slot>
  clan buffs replace <family number> <tier> <slot> <current activation UID>
  clan buffs cancel <activation UID>
  clan buffs permission <maximum rank>

The list shows your clan's unlocked buffs, tier prices, available slots,
active buffs and family cooldowns. Family numbers are:

  1 Scholar's Encouragement   2 Arcane Readiness   3 Psionic Focus
  4 Company Vitality          5 Artisan's Guidance

Activation spends shared Influence. You must be a current accepted member
with buff-management permission. A clan leader can delegate management to
accepted ranks 1 through the chosen maximum; zero restores leader-only.
The chosen rank must exist. Staff status does not bypass these checks.
Buffs must be enabled for your clan by the game's trusted configuration.

Cancelling gives no refund. Replacement also gives no refund and does not
clear either family's cooldown. Replacing an occupied slot requires the
active UID shown by the list:

  clan buffs replace <family> <tier> <slot> <current activation UID>

The game creates an operation UID for you.
The command prints an exact retry command before requesting a change. If
an error says the result is uncertain, use that exact command instead of
starting another operation. An identical retry returns the original result
without charging again; changing its arguments produces a conflict.

An unoccupied activation and cancellation create the operation UID for you.
For an explicit retry, use:

  clan buffs activate <family> <tier> <slot> <operation UID> <clan UID> [active UID]
  clan buffs cancel <active UID> <operation UID> <clan UID>

See also: CLANPROGRESSION, CLAN
